.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# output/ is NOT ignored. usage_log.json, audit_trail.json and
# trap_calls.json are the evidence the report rests on, and the course
# expects them in the repo. Ignoring them would quietly drop the proof
# for three graded sections.

# Local editor/launcher config. Machine-specific absolute paths, and of
# no use to anyone cloning this.
.claude/
